<svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg> </a> <a href="/contact/" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-white/40 hover:border-white text-white font-medium px-5 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors sm:w-auto sm:px-7 sm:py-3.5">Request a Quote</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section id="package-model" class="py-20 bg-white"> <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"> <div class="text-center mb-14"> <p class="text-[#2d5a27] text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3">The Complete Package</p> <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Four Layers of a Solar Roof Supply</h2> <p class="text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Every Sunlit supply package covers all four layers. One factory, one quote, one shipment — no sourcing gaps on site.</p> </div> <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6"> <div class="sunlit-card p-6 text-center hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform"> <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-soft-green text-deep-green flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 48 48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-10 h-10"><rect x="4" y="16" width="40" height="26" rx="2"/><path d="M4 22h40M14 22v20M24 22v20M34 22v20M10 16V10a2 2 0 012-2h24a2 2 0 012 2v6"/><circle cx="24" cy="7" r="2"/><path d="M20 10l4-3 4 3"/></svg></div> <div class="text-gray-300 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest mb-2">01</div> <p class="text-xs text-[#2d5a27] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Generate Power</p> <h3 class="text-gray-900 font-bold text-lg mb-2">Active PV Elements</h3> <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Solar-generating glass tiles (Lumina Slate) or metal roof sheets (Storm Guard). The power-producing core of the roof.</p> </div><div class="sunlit-card p-6 text-center hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform"> <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-soft-green text-deep-green flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 48 48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-10 h-10"><rect x="6" y="26" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><rect x="26" y="26" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><rect x="16" y="6" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M14 26l10-4 10 4"/></svg></div> <div class="text-gray-300 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest mb-2">02</div> <p class="text-xs text-[#2d5a27] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Complete the Roof Surface</p> <h3 class="text-gray-900 font-bold text-lg mb-2">Matching Inactive Elements</h3> <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Non-generating tiles or sheets with the same appearance as the active elements. Used on shaded areas, edges and non-solar sections.</p> </div><div class="sunlit-card p-6 text-center hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform"> <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-soft-green text-deep-green flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 48 48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-10 h-10"><path d="M6 42V20L24 6l18 14v22"/><path d="M6 20h36"/><path d="M16 42V28h16v14"/><path d="M24 6v6"/><path d="M4 42h40"/></svg></div> <div class="text-gray-300 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest mb-2">03</div> <p class="text-xs text-[#2d5a27] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Weatherproof the Edges</p> <h3 class="text-gray-900 font-bold text-lg mb-2">Trim, Flashing &amp; Fixings</h3> <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ridge pieces, gable panels, eave starters, valley flashing, fasteners and sealant tape. Every edge and transition point covered.</p> </div><div class="sunlit-card p-6 text-center hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform"> <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-soft-green text-deep-green flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 48 48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-10 h-10"><rect x="8" y="4" width="24" height="32" rx="2"/><path d="M16 4v32"/><path d="M32 12l8 4-8 4"/><path d="M14 12h8M14 18h8M14 24h8"/><path d="M32 36h8M36 32v8"/></svg></div> <div class="text-gray-300 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest mb-2">04</div> <p class="text-xs text-[#2d5a27] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Support the Project</p> <h3 class="text-gray-900 font-bold text-lg mb-2">Project Documents</h3> <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Datasheet, installation guide, BOM, packing list, test reports and export documentation. Everything needed to move the project forward.</p> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50"> <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"> <div class="text-center mb-14"> <p class="text-[#2d5a27] text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3">Two Product Lines</p> <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Lumina Slate vs Storm Guard</h2> <p class="text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Both lines are factory-supplied as complete packages. The choice depends on project type, aesthetic requirement and budget position.</p> </div> <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-10"> <!-- Lumina Slate --> <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"> <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden"> <img src="/images/projects/hangzhou-xianghu-arcadia-villa/sunlit-bipv-solar-roof-aerial-view-hangzhou-xianghu.webp" alt="Lumina Slate installed on Hangzhou Xianghu Arcadia Villa" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /> <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent"></div> <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-5"><span class="bg-white text-[#2d5a27] text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Premium Glass Tile Line</span></div> </div> <div class="p-5 sm:p-8"> <h3 class="text-gray-900 text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Lumina Slate</h3> <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">Glass solar roof tiles with a slate-like premium finish. Designed for villas, high-end homes and architecture-led projects where appearance is part of the value proposition.</p> <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-5 sunlit-mobile-grid"> <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-3"><div class="text-gray-400 text-xs mb-1">Power per Tile</div><div class="text-gray-900 font-bold">70W</div></div> <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-3"><div class="text-gray-400 text-xs mb-1">Tile Size</div><div class="text-gray-900 font-bold text-xs">1240 × 390 × 6.2 mm</div></div> <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-3"><div class="text-gray-400 text-xs mb-1">Cell Type</div><div class="text-gray-900 font-bold text-xs">Monocrystalline PERC</div></div> <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-3"><div class="text-gray-400 text-xs mb-1">Encapsulation</div><div class="text-gray-900 font-bold text-xs">Double glass adhesive</div></div> </div> <a href="/lumina-slate/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#2d5a27] hover:bg-[#1a4d16] text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm">Explore Lumina Slate →</a> </div> </div> <!-- Storm Guard --> <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"> <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden"> <img src="/images/projects/large-scale-commercial-complex/storm-guard-large-scale-bipv-integration-aerial-scaled.webp" alt="Storm Guard" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /> <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent"></div> <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-5"><span class="bg-amber text-gray-900 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Modern Metal Sheet Line</span></div> </div> <div class="p-5 sm:p-8"> <h3 class="text-gray-900 text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Storm Guard</h3> <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">Standing-seam Al-Mg-Mn metal solar roof sheets engineered for large-scale, practical and typhoon-rated projects where durability and cost efficiency must coexist.</p> <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-5 sunlit-mobile-grid"> <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-3"><div class="text-gray-400 text-xs mb-1">Power per Sheet</div><div class="text-gray-900 font-bold">135W</div></div> <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-3"><div class="text-gray-400 text-xs mb-1">Sheet Size</div><div class="text-gray-900 font-bold text-xs">1950 × 420 mm</div></div> <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-3"><div class="text-gray-400 text-xs mb-1">Cell Type</div><div class="text-gray-900 font-bold text-xs">Monocrystalline TOPCON</div></div> <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-3"><div class="text-gray-400 text-xs mb-1">IP Rating</div><div class="text-gray-900 font-bold">IP68</div></div> </div> <a href="/storm-guard/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-amber hover:bg-amber-dark text-gray-900 font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm">Explore Storm Guard →</a> </div> </div> </div> <!-- Mobile: each decision criterion exposes both product values without horizontal swiping. --> <div class="space-y-3 sm:hidden" aria-label="Lumina Slate and Storm Guard mobile comparison"> <article class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-4 shadow-sm bg-white"> <h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold text-gray-800">Active Element</h3> <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"> <div class="min-w-0 rounded-xl bg-[#edf6f1] p-3"> <p class="mb-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#2d5a27]">Lumina Slate</p> <p class="text-sm font-semibold leading-snug text-gray-800 break-words">Glass PV Tile</p> </div> <div class="min-w-0 rounded-xl bg-[#fff7eb] p-3"> <p class="mb-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#9a650f]">Storm Guard</p> <p class="text-sm font-semibold leading-snug text-gray-800 break-words">Metal Solar Sheet</p> </div> </div> </article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-4 shadow-sm bg-gray-50"> <h3 class="m